{
  "page": "/run50/wechat/west-lake-half-marathon-modern-rail.html",
  "title": "RunCN #第21站｜西湖半马：我去西湖跑半马，偶遇跑者施一公",
  "ready": false,
  "images": 54,
  "slug": "west-lake-half-marathon",
  "intro": "从上海到杭州，去西湖边甩肉，跑一场半马，也偶遇了跑者施一公。",
  "map": "/assets/cn-article-maps/china-light-c2c474ad46ce4cbc.png",
  "poster": "../../assets/cover-medal-west-lake-half-marathon.jpg?v=20260628-runcn-distinct-v1",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-001.webp",
      "caption": "西湖印象 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 1"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #294f7a; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">一面山水 一面大学</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">六月份从武大毕业，那之后体重长了不少，心态更是逐渐咸鱼化。没事总爱摸摸自己的肚子，然后和朋友调侃，男哥已经退役，跑圈不再有哥的传说，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">有事请来学术圈找我</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">朋友回复：“男哥，你还年轻。”用手摸了摸自己浓密的头发，觉得朋友好像也没说错，至少还没秃头呢，那就哪天秃头了再考虑退役的事吧。做个行动派，先去西湖跑个半马找找感觉，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #306eaa;padding-bottom:2px;\">看看还行不行</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-002.webp",
      "caption": "周末去西湖甩肉。 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "周末去西湖甩肉。 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "西湖大学，偶遇施一公院士"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">上海和杭州真的近，火车不到两小时就到了，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">住宿选在了西湖</strong>边的青芝坞，环境很好。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">西湖是现今《世界遗产名录》中国唯一一个湖泊类文化遗产。从南宋流传至今的“西湖十景”依然是游客来到杭州一定要去打卡朝圣的地方。上世纪<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">80年</strong>代评选出的“新西湖十景”，也声名大噪，成为了游客们的新宠。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-003.webp",
      "caption": "西湖神州网红小船。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 3"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-004.webp",
      "caption": "西湖神州网红小船。 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 4"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">听说西湖的日出很漂亮，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">我就定了早晨五点的闹钟</strong>，准备追一追西湖的早晨。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-005.webp",
      "caption": "西湖神州早晨。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">早晨五点半，我跟着<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">导航骑着单车来到了西湖</strong>边的“神州基地”，网上说这里看日出不错。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">“西湖神州”是西湖的一隅，水面静卧着十来艘小船，配合着粼粼的波光，相异于断桥的人流，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #9a681c;padding-bottom:2px;\">有一种“野渡无人舟自横”的闲趣</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-006.webp",
      "caption": "航拍西湖神州小船。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 6"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-007.webp",
      "caption": "航拍西湖神州小船。 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 7"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">一位老大爷和小哥已经等在了这里，本以为西湖的日出会很壮丽，结果这里只能看到日出的红晕，大爷告诉我们，想看完整的日出可以到对面的苏堤。西湖的水面弥漫着白色的水气，在淡粉色的光晕中，有一种说不出的梦幻。不过没看到完整的日出，还是有点<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #ac4336;padding-bottom:2px;\">遗憾</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-008.webp",
      "caption": "航拍西湖早晨。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 8"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-009.webp",
      "caption": "西湖偶遇大爷和小哥。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 9"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">大爷是本地人，说可以带我们去另一个景点弥补一下遗憾，大概骑了两公里，我们来到武状元坊，这边的景色很秀丽也很精致。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-010.webp",
      "caption": "武状元坊。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 10"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-011.webp",
      "caption": "武状元坊水中倒影。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 11"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-012.webp",
      "caption": "武状元坊。 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 12"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">武状元坊是三台山路浴鹄湾西侧的一个牌坊，始建于1214年，2003年重建。看上去很有气势，武状元坊边上有黄公望故居——子久草堂。黄公望，元代画家《富春山居图》的作者。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-013.webp",
      "caption": "航拍霁虹桥。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 13"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-014.webp",
      "caption": "航拍霁虹桥。 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 14"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-015.webp",
      "caption": "航拍霁虹桥。 · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 15"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">早餐吃了有名的杭州汤包，之后取了跑步装备，中午去浙大玉泉校区找了武大师兄刚儿哥聊人生，刚儿哥是学术大佬浙大博士，刚儿哥请我吃了浙大小乐惠，据说是最好吃的食堂。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-016.webp",
      "caption": "杭州汤包。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 16"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-017.webp",
      "caption": "浙大大佬刚儿哥。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 17"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-018.webp",
      "caption": "浙大小乐惠。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 18"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">别了刚儿哥，下午坐了一个半小时公交去了云溪小镇的西湖大学见check难友17妹，西湖大学就在阿里云谷对面，中国最具活力和潜力的大学，目标成为中国的“哈佛”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-019.webp",
      "caption": "西湖大学。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 19"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我一直很想一睹西湖大学风采，这次终于有机会了。17妹用校园卡接我进了学校，西湖大学不大，我们没一会就绕了一圈，又回到了校园门口，17妹说：“施一公老师每天8点左右会在这里跑步的。”</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我看了看表，怎么才5点，应该是没戏，结果一抬头，施一公老师穿着跑步装备跑进了西湖大学，简直幸运爆棚，我蹑手蹑脚的走到施老师旁边，然后试探性的问了一下施老师是否可以合影，结果施老师特别爽快的说了句：“没问题！”</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-020.webp",
      "caption": "有幸和施一公老师合影。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 20"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">施一公院士可以说是中国最具话题的学术大咖，也是中国学术圈的旗帜性人物，最让我开心的还是，施老师也是跑步爱好者，并且装备还很骚气，原来我和施老师也有共同的爱好。跑步和科研在施老师身上并不矛盾，显然施老师平衡的很好，这也是我要努力的方向。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-021.webp",
      "caption": "check难友17妹。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 21"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">17妹请吃了西湖大学食堂，还有幸见到了和我方向很类似的check难友销阳，打卡成功。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-022.webp",
      "caption": "check难友销阳。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 22"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "西湖半马，我被妹子套了圈"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">之前宿舍就在东湖边，跑东湖是我的最爱，风景很美，东湖面积是西湖的六倍，所以我一直对跑西湖抱以一种不屑的态度，觉得不会过瘾。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-023.webp",
      "caption": "西湖早晨。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 23"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">这次比赛是“爱徒野”主办，分为<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">4公里</span>和半马两个组别，总规模不过400人，半马要跑六圈。要知道东湖可以划出n条半马赛道，甚至可以举办不折返的绕湖百公里比赛，所以赛前我的兴奋点也没有多高。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-024.webp",
      "caption": "西湖日出。 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 24"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-025.webp",
      "caption": "西湖日出。 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 25"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">不过在比赛日，西湖的风景真的惊艳到我，与东湖粗犷大气不同，西湖的精致细腻别有韵味，虽然受限于景区限制，但赛道还是安排在了白堤这里举行，我想组委会一定也是进行了积极的争取。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-West-Lake-Half-Marathon-clean_files/img-026.webp",
      "caption": "西湖日出。 · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "浙江杭州故事照片 26"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
